"P856364347" ""
// Script Variable CORRECT_DELIVERY_NAME :
"P3606819814" "Kelly Uqua"
// Script Variable CORRECT_DELIVERY_TEXT :
"P2134301390" "<color orange>Kelly squirms uncomfortably as you present her the Rikti monkey, which is busy gnawing on one of its toes.</color><br><br>H-h ha ha... This couldn't be for me.<br><br><color orange>She reaches out and takes the note from the distracted Rikti monkey, which snaps at her hand playfully before expelling a flatus and dramatically waving a hand in the air. Crinkling her nose at the creature, Kelly takes a step back and looks over the note before reading it, blushing as she does so.</color><br><br>Who did you get this from? Tell me! I will pay you, just tell me... please..."
// Script Variable WRONG_DELIVERY_NAME :
"P165139696" "Ambassador Kuhr'Rekt"
// Script Variable WRONG_DELIVERY_TEXT :
"P3954177009" "Subject of discussion: My monkey. Name of monkey: Flat'Tus. Inquiry: Whereabouts? Status request: Attached note: Read? Demand: Release of Flat'Tus!"
// Script Variable VALENTINE_DISCOVERY_TEXT :
"P3099613925" "Hopping along the street is a Rikti monkey with a teal bow tied to his head and a note attached. You capture the monkey, whose particularly vivid odor is a combination of a diet consisting of cheese puffs and energy drinks along with a generous application of popularized men's body spray. The attached note is addressed to Kelly Uqua, it reads:"
// Script Variable VALENTINE_TEXT :
"P1667940671" "<i>My heart: Aching.<br>My knees: Quaking.<br>Result of your hostility: Harm.<br>Desired place for you: My arm.<br>Request: Say yes.<br>My feelings for you: Confess.<br>Our love: Forever.<br>Alone: Never.</i><br><br><color yellow>This isn't a normal Rikti to Human translation job; its definitely the work of either a human trying to write like a Rikti, or a Rikti who has been studying human language patterns and is trying to write in a more human manner. Either way, it's a Valentine intended for Kelly Uqua involving someone with access to a Rikti monkey... and a particularly stinky Rikti monkey at that.<br><br>You could deliver the Valentine to her as intended, or take it to Ambassador Kuhr'Rekt in order to stomp out whatever Human-Rikti relationship is going on here before it starts.</color>"
// Script Variable SENDER_NAME :
"P1849612568" "A Love Struck Rikti"
// Script Variable VALENTINE_CLUE :
"P2422987258" "This Valentine comes attached to a feisty and rather gassy Rikti monkey. The note is addressed to Kelly Uqua and contains some rather sappy Rikti poetry."
// AskAboutTextOverride :
"P3668577043" "Reconsider your options"
// ContactRequiresText :
"P3611273721" "You are of the wrong alignment to get this tip."
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P2659787689" "You're unsure of exactly what to do with this information"
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P1255120992" "This Valentine is of no use to you."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P1338064068" "You already have enough things to do."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P3623388284" "You're currently too busy to act upon this information."
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P3299591369" "Failsafe"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - DialogTree 
